een piecemeal: Tillis's blockade, Powell staying on as a governor, and court rulings that kept", "url": "https://x.com/NickTimiraos/status/2118095659936915860"}, {"author_id": "26538229", "created_at": "2026-11-04T21:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118093588085039419"], "id": "2118093588085039419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 35822, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "#FedFAQ: Do you have damaged or mutilated currency?\nConsumers should not send any currency directly to the Federal Reserve.\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/AfMFBolb48 https://t.co/dccQGtK4nC", "url": "https://x.com/federalreserve/status/2118093588085039419"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "83466368", "name": "European Central Bank", "username": "ecb"}, {"id": "1214528593", "name": "Miles Brundage", "username": "Miles_Brundage"}, {"id": "39125788", "name": "Ethan Mollick", "username": "emollick"}, {"id": "332617373", "name": "Mohamed A. El-Erian", "username": "elerianm"}, {"id": "612896910", "name": "BLS-Labor Statistics", "username": "BLS_gov"}, {"id": "279036722", "name": "Jason Furman", "username": "jasonfurman"}, {"id": "25098482", "name": "IMF", "username": "IMFNews"}, {"id": "59603406", "name": "Nick Timiraos", "username": "NickTimiraos"}, {"id": "26538229", "name": "Federal Reserve", "username": "federalreserve"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118248232648081424", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxaqeo6f98jmtb34qvxn1cfxq5", "oldest_id": "2118093588085039419", "result_count": 12}}
